:::text id=fNchNYiE-9 at=top-left width=1080 height=80 offsetX=100 offsetY=40 preset=title align=center color=text
# Pet Peeves vs Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=W-0rLLz8NN at=top-left width=520 height=480 offsetX=100 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16 shadow=md
:::

:::text id=ozi4Fdz25z at=top-left width=460 height=40 offsetX=130 offsetY=190 preset=caption align=center color=#DC2626
PET PEEVES (WHAT TO AVOID)
:::

:::text id=B5_94crorT at=top-left width=460 height=360 offsetX=130 offsetY=250 preset=body align=left color=text
- **Unscheduled Syncs:** Unscheduled communication for non-urgent matters interrupt deep flow.

- **Unexplained Refusal:** Dismissing ideas or proposals without providing context or underlying reasons.
:::

:::shape id=4Hj6BENBBR at=top-left width=520 height=480 offsetX=660 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16 shadow=md
:::

:::text id=-GidwZa8ml at=top-left width=460 height=40 offsetX=690 offsetY=190 preset=caption align=center color=#16A34A
GOLDEN RULES (BEST PRACTICE)
:::

:::text id=YBuCFGA89N at=top-left width=460 height=360 offsetX=690 offsetY=250 preset=body align=left color=text
- **Advance Notice:** Give heads-up or schedule beforehand for synchronous check-ins.

- **Constructive Pushback:** Always share rationale when rejecting ideas, & suggest alternative paths.
:::
